    "finalName": "",
    "description": "You know how to intentionally crash an opponent's moving <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vehicle\">Vehicle</a>. When you successfully deal damage to a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vehicle\">Vehicle</a> by <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Ramming\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ramming\">Ramming</a> it, your Vehicle takes half damage from the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Ram\" title=\"Ram\">Ram</a>. Additionally, if the target <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vehicle\">Vehicle</a> is the same size as your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vehicle\">Vehicle</a> or smaller, that Vehicle cannot move in the following round.",
